# Stories photo library

When choosing or replacing Stories images, **check the local bank first** before asking for new downloads.

## Where files live

| Location | Purpose |
|----------|---------|
| `uploads/instagram-library/` | Canonical local bank (40 IG posts synced Jul 2026) |
| `uploads/instagram-library/INDEX.md` | Subject index, slide counts, used vs available |
| `~/Downloads/instagram_*` | User drop folder (same posts; library is the working copy) |

## Rules

1. Prefer **`available`** posts in `INDEX.md`. Avoid reusing **`used`** posts unless the user asks.
2. Copy chosen files into `public/images/` as dated `blog-<slug>-…` names; do not hotlink Downloads.
3. Portrait photos: set `fit: "contain"` (+ real `width`/`height`) so they are not 16:10-cropped.
4. After publishing, mark the IG short id as used in `INDEX.md` (which story/slot).
5. New user uploads of `instagram_*` folders → rsync into `uploads/instagram-library/` and append `INDEX.md`.

